        "html": "<h1 id=\"context-001-reading-list\">Context 001 — Reading list</h1>\n<h2 id=\"goal-confirmed-2026-03-03t09-30-00z\">Goal — confirmed 2026-03-03T09:30:00Z</h2>\n<p>A reader saves a link in one step, finds it again by title or tag, and reads it offline.</p>\n<h2 id=\"round-1-no-gaps-the-repo-could-not-close-2026-03-03t09-30-00z\">Round 1 — no gaps the repo could not close, 2026-03-03T09:30:00Z</h2>",
